  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Settlement Extents v4.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Settlement Extents v4.0 dataset is a spatial data layer in OGC Geopackage format. This version supersedes GRID3 COD - Settlement Extents v3.1. The following changes were made: Creation of blocks in urban and semi-urban areas; Removal of hamlets and edge-blocks with zero-building count unless settlement has been confirmed through fieldwork Change of data schema",
